# against every message Claude speaks. Blank lines and # comments ignored.
#
# Extending a rule is one appended line here. It never requires editing a hook,
# which is the point: the last rule was missed because adding it meant editing
# the guard, and that got forgotten.
#
# Patterns are written to avoid containing the very string they forbid, so this
# file can be maintained without the guard denying its own maintenance.

# feedback_no_meekness_markers — hedges a claim that stands on its own
hon[e]st

# law_operations — no trailer naming a model or a tool
Co-Auth[o]red-By
Generated with .*Claude Code

# law_vocabulary_and_notation — the notation is the twelve marks and the Shavian
# values, bare. These letters are a foreign gloss on the axis marks; write the
# mark itself or the value name. Not cosmetic: the Hebrew gloss on the
# cardinality axis inverted an ordinal against Core.lean and shifted every
# crystal address the kernel derived.
